  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Capacity for Low Emission Development Strategies (EC-LEDS) in the Agricultural Sector Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To build upon previous EC-LEDS cooperation between the United States Department of State (DOS) and the United States, Department of Agriculture/Foreign Agricultural Service (USDA/FAS) to support low emissions development in the agricultural sectors in targeted developing countries by supporting activities such as: adapting tools and technologies to promote and quantify agricultural practices that reduce emissions, training agricultural sector stakeholders in those adapted tools and best practices, engaging government officials to promote low emissions in agriculture, and providing support to the Low Emission Development Strategies Global Partnership.</narrative>
  </description>
